    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d543">

                <pb facs="0608" n="558" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg558"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Prince Cantacuzene to
                        Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Russian Imperial Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-01"><hi rendition="#italic">November 1,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I just received the
                    following dispatch from Mr. de Giers: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>It has pleased our Lord to recall to Him our much beloved sovereign.
                            Emperor Alexander the Third died at Livadia this afternoon, the 20th
                            October (1st November) at 2:15.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Giers.</hi></p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>In deep grief, very sincerely, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cantacuzène.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
